- S052–S057: round-16 rows (C1 operator/target/equivalence sources; C2 cold-read classification and executable-example sources).
- S058–S064: round-17 rows (C1 input-keyed credit and trace sources; C2 repo identity, jj HEAD and git environment sources).
- Next unused id: S065.


